id 1712 "The document is the main area — what is left when the panels and toolbars have taken their place. Drag a panel's header or tab, or a toolbar's grip — the window follows. Release where the placeholder shows to dock: onto the middle of another panel it becomes a tab, near its edge a stack, near the window's edge a new strip. Released anywhere else it floats; double-click the header to dock it back."
id 1713 "Search for:"
id 1714 "Collapse a panel with the arrow in its header — it becomes a handle on the edge, and a click expands it again. The View menu brings back a closed panel."
id 1715 "The explorer is at least 160 and at most 400 px wide."
id 1716 "No layout saved yet"
