# ---- widget_gallery: the Markdown view (group 37)
id 1970 "37 · Markdown"
id 1971 "Link: "
id 1972 "# The Markdown view\n\nA **formatted** text in a *scrolling* area — with `code`, [a link](https://github.com/holmbom/GlazeUI \"GlazeUI on GitHub\") and images: ![Info](ikon) ![Gear](toolbar/gear)\n\n## Lists\n\n- a bullet with **bold** text\n- [switch to the Tables and trees tab](demo:data)\n  - a nested bullet\n\n1. one\n2. two\n\n> A quote\nwith a lazy line.\n\n---\n\n## Code\n\n```\nfor (int i = 0; i < 3; ++i)\n    draw(i);\n```\n\n| Left | Centre | Right |\n|:--|:-:|--:|\n| a | **b** | 12 |\n| c | `d` | 345 |\n\n[To the top](#the-markdown-view) · [To the code](#code)"
id 1973 "A **short** view with AUTO height: it grows when the window gets narrower."
id 1974 "This line follows the short view's height."
